  "description": "\u201cThe perspector of the inward equilateral triangles erected on sides BC, CA, AB of triangle ABC.\u201d\n\u2014 Clark Kimberling's Encyclopedia of Triangle Centers (ETC) \u2022 X_14 (2nd Isogonic Center)\n\nInteractive GEOMETOR Explorer page: https://geometor.github.io/etc/centers/c-00001-00019/x-00014/\n\n1 \u00b7 CONSTRUCT: X_14 = 2nd Isogonic Center \u2022 Inward Equilateral Perspector\n2 \u00b7 GOAL: X_14 = 2nd Isogonic Center \u2022 Inward Equilateral Perspector\n3 \u00b7 ASSERT: Trilinears csc(A - \u03c0/3) : csc(B - \u03c0/3) : csc(C - \u03c0/3)\n4 \u00b7 INTERSECT: Lines {6, 13, 14} \u2022 {2, 14, 15} \u2022 {3, 14, 18} \u2022 {5, 14, 17}\n5 \u00b7 INTERSECT: Lines {6, 13, 14} \u2022 {2, 14, 15} \u2022 {3, 14, 18} \u2022 {5, 14, 17}\n6 \u00b7 PROVE: Isogonal Conjugate X_16 (2nd Isodynamic) \u2022 Inverse X_13\n7 \u00b7 \u2234: Kimberling (6, 9, 13) Search = 4.373431772013\n\nGEOMETOR \u2022 ETC \u2022 X_14",
